desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_000_0=A map of the Northern Plains with nothing but a few ambiguous directions. Perhaps someone might want it.  (Level 0 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_001z_0=An Changfeng Escort Agency token. Use it to get what you want from the sphere of influence of Changfeng. Of course, the Longmen Inn token is not always recognized within the Northern Plains. (After obtaining the Longmen In Token you will advance the righteous storyline and receive a great amount of affinity) (Level 1 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_001x_0=A secret message from Lord Qin's Residence urging all parties to cooperate and spare no effort in apprehending Tian Xi. Some people in the Northern Plains will  be willing to comply with what is stated in the secret message. (After obtaining the Longmen In Token you will advance the sinister storyline and receive a great amount of affinity) (Level 1 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_002_0=This sword is important evidence pertaining to the destruction of the Ice Spirit Castle that happened 8 years ago. (Level 1 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_003_0=One of the more unique poisons. After being poisoned, one can never be exposed to light must live in the dark for half a month. (Level 3 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_004_0=A net made by Bloody Silk. Resistant to water and fire. Be cautious when using it as someone with enormous power covets it. (Level 4 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_005_0=A white jade box adorned with a faded pattern. Designed to contain blood worms. Perhaps with this you can track down the real murderer. (Level 5 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_006_0=It is said that when the fragments are combined it forms a treasure map, though no one can decipher the markings. Perhaps the route shown is not within the Northern Plains. (Level 6 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_007_0=A skeleton made of gold that is said to be the key to the treasure. Since no one knows how to use this key to find the treasure, it might be just an expensive trash.  (Level 7 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_008_0=A token of the Demon's Gang, this ferocious looking mask is a key piece of evidence. (Level 8 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_009_0=A hairpin made of first-rate white jade. Appears to be one-part of a pair and looks exactly like the hairpin Tian Xi wore at the time of the crime. (Level 9 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_010x_0=This twin fish-shaped jade pendant was crafted using secret methods by the Plague Lady. A mysterious item though also quite useful. (Level 10 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_011x_0=A scroll depicting women with flower hairpins, sealed with the imperial seal. A crucial item... (Level 11 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_012_0=Perfume with something mysterious within. Also an important item for uncovering the truth and obtaining the ancient manual. (Level 12 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_010z_0=Generally used by women find out if a man truly loves them. If poisoned by it you will become old within a half hour.  (Level 10 Item)
desc_item_newworld_beiyuan_task_011z_0=Those in possession of this item can ask a favor from the master of the Remuneration Arrow. It is also a key item related to the Divine Water Palace. (Level 10 item)
