box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01=Music Score of the Western Wind
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01_0=Music score for the Wind of the West.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01_1=Music score recording the wind of the west. It is of great west regional characteristics and people understand it differently. It is said that some music enthusiasts are trying to gather the music comprehension.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01=Right-click to gain proficiency in this skill.
box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01=Score of the North's Affection
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01_0=A music score recording the affection of the north. For many it is difficult to properly comprehend.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01_1=Music score recording the affection of the north. It is of great north plain characteristics and people understand it differently. It is said that some music enthusiasts are trying to gather the music comprehension.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01=Right-click to experience and to gain the skill proficiency.
box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01_huai=Messy Music Score for the Wind of the West.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01_huai_0=Music score recording the Wind of the West. Looks pretty messy though.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01_huai_1=Music score recording the wind of the west. Looks pretty messy though. It is of great west regional characteristics and people understand it differently. It is said that some music enthusiasts are trying to gather the music comprehension.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_tanqin01_huai=Right-click to experience and to gain the skill proficiency.
box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01_huai=Score of the North's Affection(Messy)
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01_huai_0=A music score recording the affection of the north. This one appears rather messy though. For many it is difficult to properly comprehend.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01_huai_1=Music score recording the affection of the north. Looks pretty messy though. It is of great north plain characteristics and people understand it differently. It is said that some music enthusiasts are trying to gather the music comprehension.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_tanqin01_huai=Right-click to experience and to gain the skill proficiency.
item_newword_xyxinde_01_hao=Profound Experience of the Wind of the Western Region
desc_item_newword_xyxinde_01_hao_0=Enjoy the scenery of the Western Region. Comprehend the music score of the Wind of the Western Region and to receive skill proficiency.
desc_item_newword_xyxinde_01_hao_1=Enjoy the scenery of the west region. Comprehend the music score of the wind of the west and to gain the skill proficiency.
desc_item_newword_xyxinde_01_hao=It is said that the Traveling Servant is collecting this.
item_newword_xyxinde_02_huai=Shallow Experience of the Wind of the Western Region
desc_item_newword_xyxinde_02_huai_0=While attempting to comprehend the music score of the Wind of the West, you were disturbed and failed to gain the skill proficiency.
desc_item_newword_xyxinde_02_huai_1=When you were comprehending the music score of the wind of the west, you were disturbed by some external things and you fail to gain the skill proficiency.
desc_item_newword_xyxinde_02_huai=It is said that Jianghu Attendant is collecting this.
item_newword_byxinde_01_hao=Profound Experience of the Affection of the Northern Plains
desc_item_newword_byxinde_01_hao_0=Enjoy the scenery of the Northern Plains. Comprehend the music score of the Affection of the Northern Plains and to receive skill proficiency.
desc_item_newword_byxinde_01_hao_1=Enjoy the scenery of the north plain. Comprehend the music score of the affection of the north and to gain the skill proficiency.
desc_item_newword_byxinde_01_hao=It is said that Jianghu Attendant is collecting this.
item_newword_byxinde_02_huai=Shallow Experience of the Affection of the Northern Plains
desc_item_newword_byxinde_02_huai_0=When you were attempting to comprehend the music score of the Affection of the Northern Plains, you were disturbed and you failed to gain the skill proficiency.
