item_newword_loulan_01=Scroll of the Landscape of the Western Region (Part 1)
desc_item_newword_loulan_01_0=You can see the entirety of the picture with this and the other two parts. The government has offered a reward for the complete scroll.
desc_item_newword_loulan_01_1=Part1 Scroll of the landscape of the west region. It seems that you can see the whole picture with the other 2 parts and the government has offered a reward for this.
