box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw04=Gift for the Lucky
box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw05=Tiger General of the Desert Ghost Town
box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw06=Faith of Heaven Net Cult
box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw07=Honor of Bringer of Peace
box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw08=Luolan Descendant's Gratitude
box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw09=A Gift from the Mistress
box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw10=Victory of the West Xia
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw01=The Glory of Justice
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw02=Ambitious Hero Commendation
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw03=A Puppet's Dream
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw04=Treasure of the Ancient Tomb
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw05=Treasure of the Divine Water Palace
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw06=The Gift of Discipleship
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw07=Comfort of the Brave
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw08=Ginseng Collector
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw09=A Demon's Tribute
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw10=Gift of the Sinister Beggars
box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw11=The Price of Passion
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw01_1=Flicks the robes after the deed is done, leaving face and name unknown. It is the hero spirit every righteous person is supposed to have. And some events that benefit our people can never be forgotten. I don't deserve these gifts.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw02_1=Life's journey is never easy, no matter what path you take.  One thing is for certain though, one who receives recognition from Demon Blade Elder, is not far from dominating the world.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw04_1=Those in Jianghu who are able to achieve success may not always be the most capable, but they are the luckiest.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw05_1=The master of the Desert Ghost Town, Lei Xingkong, owns innumerable amounts of treasure, weapons and martial arts scriptures. As Lei Xingkong's capable assistant, money is not an issue provided contribution is made.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw06_1=The Heaven Net Cult follow beliefs not recognized or accepted by others.  Once you have earned the trust of the Heaven Net Cult and become their ambassador, you'll understand the benefits of their beliefs.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw07_1=Although a small country, Guiziguo is rather wealthy and peaceful. As long as they have their Anguo Master, their stability shall continue. As such, the Anguo Master deserves the most valuable gift in the country.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw08_1=Loulan Dynasty has long since ended and the later generations strive to protect the treasure of their land. Fortunately they have some righteous people willing to help protect it, provided they are granted a percentage of said treasure.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw09_1=Shi Guanyin's unique skill is a feared due to her peerless martial art skills. After becoming her favorite servant, you now have plenty of chances to learn from her.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw10_1=Although the heights of the West Xia has ended, it's people still remain. They brought the war to Jianghu and shared the spoils with those who once made a contribution to West Xia.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw01_1=Only by upholding justice can you truly earn the respect of the Jianghu people.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw02_1=With this, no one can question your ambition or ability to carry it out.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw03_1=We can be controlled but freedom and hope can not be deprived. The despair of the Nameless Cave might be diminished from the moment you have this in your hand.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw04_1=Though you have passed through countless dangers, your survival is not guaranteed. Perhaps the treasure of the Ancient Tomb can provide an advantage.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw05_1=Do not give up the hope for survival even in the face of failure. At least you have this…
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw06_1=The Snowy Mountain Wanderer is legendary in Jianghu. You are lucky to be recognized by him, meaning peerless techniques shall be bestowed upon you.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw07_1=Courage and resolution mean much but resourcefulness and force are also necessary when in Jianghu. Although you have not yet made any notable contributions, your effort cannot be ignored.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw08_1=What Ginseng collectors can offer might not be invaluable, but to them it is. Even if you lack fame or wealth, your actions still feel rewarding.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw09_1=The Blackpool Devil is not well-behaved and repelled by Shaolin, but you are willing to stand by his side. This gift is tribute to your allegiance.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw10_1=Things don't often end well for an excessively virtuous man in this dangerous world. Perhaps you can learn from the deception of the sinister beggar.
desc_box_newworld_beiyuan_jh_nw11_1=Ever since the time begins, affection leaves nothing but regret, which lasts forever. You couldn't help sighing with such emotions after the whole experience. Here is something for you to remember your journey.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw01=Right-click to receive the reward.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw02=Right click to receive the End Reward.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw03=Right click to receive the End Reward.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw04=Right click to receive the End Reward.
