desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw08=Right click to receive the End Reward.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw09=Right click to receive the End Reward.
desc_box_newworld_xiyu_jh_nw10=Right click to receive the End Reward.
