desc_Tab_b_cloth001_0=This is a drawing of clothes that is especially favored by the people of Jianghu. People can use it to change the style of Jianghu Costume. Open <font color="#99cc00">Dressing Cabinet</font> to transform Equipment to change its style. <br><font color="#96a0c8">When the altered design is stored in the backpack, right-click to add it to the diagram collection. </font>
