item_newschool_gumu_001=Tao Te Ching (Ancient Scroll)
desc_item_newschool_gumu_001_0=It was written around 6th century BC by the sage Lao Tzu. The text, along with the Zhuangzi, is a fundamental text for both philosophical and religious Taoism. (Used to eliminate the effects that the<font color="#ff0000"> Marriage/Divorce times </font>have on joining the Reclusive Schools. After holding this item, the Divorce-related titles can no longer be used.)
item_newschool_gumu_002=Yin Symbol Seven Techniques Document (Ancient Scroll)
item_newschool_gumu_003=Eighty-eight Buddha Repentance Document (Ancient Scroll)
item_newschool_gumu_fenye_001=Eighty-eight Buddha Repentance Pages (Ancient Scroll)
desc_item_newschool_gumu_fenye_001_0=The 88 Buddhas are the lords of penance for all beings in Buddhism. People can tell them of their repentance and changed evil desires. Ancient law stipulates that 108 ceremonies are required to read The Text of Repentance. (Collect 7 to exchange for a whole book at Jinling Lingxu (Enlightened One). <font color="#ff0000"> (1151.544) </font>This item can be obtained once a day through completing the quests)
item_newschool_gumu_fenye_002=Tao Te Ching Pages (Ancient Scroll)
desc_item_newschool_gumu_fenye_002_0=During the Spring and Autumn Period , Laozi wrote that respect is the primary essence of Taoism. The spirit of Taoism is philosophical and focuses on the forces of extremes such as the cultivation of one mind , sitting in forgetfulness , and acceptance. ( Collect 7 to exchange for a whole book at Jinling Lingxu ( Enlightened One) . <font color="#ff0000"> ( 1151.544 ) </font>This item can be obtained once a day through completing the quests )
item_newschool_gumu_fenye_003=Yin Symbol Seven Techniques Pages (Ancient Scroll)
desc_item_newschool_gumu_fenye_003_0=The body and mind cultivation masterpiece passed on during the Warring States Period was written by Guiguzi. It describes the philosophy where the spirit is that of the heavens , and appearance is that of the beholder. ( Collect 7 to exchange for a whole book at Jinling Lingxu ( Enlightened One) . <font color="#ff0000"> ( 1151.544 ) </font>This item can be obtained once a day through completing the quests )
