item_guildwar_kuafu_gold=Guild Ancient Coins
desc_item_guildwar_kuafu_gold_0=Earn these Ancient Coins from cross-server guild battles, and exchange them for guild resources. <font color="#ff0000">Exchange with merchants at Yanjing (278,-69), Suzhou (500,319), Luoyang (1047,326), and Chengdu (668,600).</font>You can also exchange for rare medicines while inside the cross server battlefield. <font color="#ff0000">You can have no more than 1500 Guild Ancient Coins.</font>
