Item_guildbattle_jineng001=Warrior Spirit's Drive (Guild Battle)
Item_guildbattle_jineng002=Warrior Spirit's Escape (Guild Battle)
Item_guildbattle_jineng003=Warrior Spirit's Tiger (Guild Battle)
Item_guildbattle_jineng004=Warrior Spirit's Speed (Guild Battle)
Item_guildbattle_jineng005=Warrior Spirit's Breakthrough (Guild Battle)
Item_guildbattle_jineng006=Warrior Spirit's Poison (Guild Battle)
desc_Item_guildbattle_jineng001_0=This medicine slowly restores your energy, and grants you the use of the Warrior Spirit's Drive skill.<br>Warrior Spirit's Drive reduces the damage you receive by 50% for 12 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3333">This powerful medicine cannot be used outside the cross-server guild battle.</font>
desc_Item_guildbattle_jineng002_0=This medicine slowly restores your Flying Skills, and grants you the use of the Warrior Spirit's Escape skill.<br>Warrior Spirit's Escape cancels all control effects on you (such as stun or paralysis) and restores a small amount of HP. <br><font color="#FF3333">This powerful medicine cannot be used outside the cross-server guild battle.</font>
desc_Item_guildbattle_jineng003_0=This medicine slowly restores your HP, and grants you the use of the Warrior Spirit's Tiger skill.<br>Warrior Spirit's Tiger gives you Red Super Armor for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3333">This powerful medicine cannot be used outside the cross-server guild battle.</font>
desc_Item_guildbattle_jineng004_0=This medicine increases your movement speed, and grants you the use of the Warrior Spirit's Speed skill.<br>Warrior Spirit's Speed restores 100 Flying Skill Points. <br><font color="#FF3333">This powerful medicine cannot be used outside the cross-server guild battle.</font>
desc_Item_guildbattle_jineng005_0=This medicine slowly restores your energy, and grants you the use of the Warrior Spirit's Breakthrough skill.<br>Warrior Spirit's Breakthrough removes Red Super Armor from your enemy. <br><font color="#FF3333">This powerful medicine cannot be used outside the cross-server guild battle.</font>
desc_Item_guildbattle_jineng006_0=This medicine slowly restores your HP, and grants you the use of the Warrior Spirit's Poison skill.<br>Within 18 seconds, Warrior Spirit's Poison slows your enemies for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3333">This powerful medicine cannot be used outside the cross-server guild battle.</font>
