desc_item_newschool_gumu_002_0=A body and mind cultivation masterpiece written by Guiguzi and passed on during the Warring States Period. It describes a philosophy where the spirit is that of the Heavens and appearance is that of the beholder. (Used to eliminate the effects that the <font color="#ff0000">Sunflower Manual</font>, <font color="#ff0000">Eunuchs</font> and the <font color="#ff0000">Heartless Blade</font> have on joining reclusive factions. When in possession of this item, the Sunflower Manual related titles can no longer be used)
