task_newmp_gumu_041=The Ancient Tomb Sect has a relationship with Wudang. Players can also learn about how to join the Ancient Tomb Sect from <font color="#FF0000">Feeble Old Man</font> in Yanjing <font color="#FF0000"> ( 485, -106 ) ( 488, -103 ) ( 478, -104 ) ( 543, -104 )</font>.
