desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gb_lhz03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Blooming Everywhere - Ultimate Domination</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. You may use the skill without having <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>. If you have Lotus Chi, you'll cost 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to increase the skill effect range by 2 meters.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Ultimate Domination] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gb_lhz07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Green Lotus - Ultimate Domination</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it. </font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. You may use the skill without having <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Ultimate Domination] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_gb_lhz08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Submerge The Lotus - Ultimate Domination</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it. </font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Ending skill becomes faster. You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Ultimate Domination] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_yzq07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Lightning Hawk Attack - Soul Coil</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it. </font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. You can <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> nearby enemies for 3 seconds while casting the skill on land. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Soul Coil] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jy_yzq08_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Hawk Flies and Tiger Feasts - Soul Coil</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Soul Coil] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wd_qfjf02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Turbulent Rapids - Sky Flying</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Increases the skill effect range to 5 meters. When releasing the skill in air, you may interrupt it by using another skill of this set.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Sky Flying] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wd_qfjf04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Blow Away in the Clear Wind - Sky Flying</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Releasing skill becomes faster.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Sky Flying] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_wd_qfjf06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Purified and Exalted - Sky Flying</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Significantly increase the skill accuracy rate.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Sky Flying] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_djgq02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Earth-shaking - Buddhism</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Change the damage type of this skill to external attack damage that affected by Brawn. The <font color="#f9fc00">Stunning</font> effect will never weaken. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Buddhism] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_djgq03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Step Forward For A Thump - Buddhism</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Change the damage type of this skill to external attack damage that affected by Brawn. This skill becomes a quicker charge skill: When charging completes you will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Away</font> enemies and additionally deal 25% of skill damage. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Buddhism] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sl_djgq04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Feint Step Intercepts Elbow - Buddhism</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. When breaking a target's parrying, adds the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Buddhism</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Fall Down</font><br> if try to use skills within 5 seconds. <br>This skill can be released in air.<font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Buddhism] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jl_zfd01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Cutting Hua Mountain - Heartless</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. When the skill hits a non-parrying enemy, adds the enemy with 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Heartless</font> stack: explode when there are 3 stacks to <font color="#f9fc00">disable the enemy's Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Heartless] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jl_zfd02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Fast Blades Shred the Grass - Heartless</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. When the skill hits a non-parrying enemy, adds the enemy with 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Heartless</font> stack: explode when there are 3 stacks to <font color="#f9fc00">disable the enemy's Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Heartless] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_lyfh04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Whisper of Falling Dust - Falling Dust</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Upon successfully parrying, there is a 25% chance to add the target with <font color="#f9fc00">Footing Unstable</font> state.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Falling Dust] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_lyfh05_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Fallen Petals - Falling Dust</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. The charging distance of this skill increases to 20 meters.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Falling Dust] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jz_lyfh07_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Snow Moon's Wind Flower - Falling Dust</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Each hit will inflict <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> for 2 seconds to the enemies who're not parrying.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Falling Dust] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_jsc03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Following Madness - Phantom Conceal</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>>Releasing the skill will enrage yourself: get 15 points of Rage, and lose 15 points of Rage after 7 seconds (You will get a 15-second Recovery state after releasing the skill. When using the skill again during the period, the amount of Rage's acquisition and loss will be 5 points, but the Recovery time won't refresh).<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Phantom Conceal] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_jsc04_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Swing the Tail - Phantom Conceal</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Releasing skill becomes faster. Target's all defense will decrease by 30% during the paralysis period.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Phantom Conceal] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_tm_jsc06_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Swallow the Whale - Phantom Conceal</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. When releasing the skill, increases the ignoring of enemies' All Defense Reduction by 8%, Parrying Damage Reduction by 8%.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Phantom Conceal] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_em_jdmz01_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Buddhist Heart Subdues the Devil - Buddha's Aura</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Releasing skill becomes faster.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Buddha's Aura] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_em_jdmz02_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Auspicious Beginning - Buddha's Aura</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Releasing skill becomes faster. Increase the range of Knock Into Air effect to 5 meters. When releasing to a target, remove 1 non-control debuff from the target and allies within 5 meters near the target. At the same time adds them with 2 buffs. <font color="#FFAE00">Auspicious</font>: Resist Knock Back, Knock Away, and Knock Into Air once within 6 seconds. <font color="#FFAE00">Beginning</font>: Increase skill damage by 20% for 6 seconds.<br> (You'll also get the buffs) <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Buddha's Aura] Martial Skills.</font><br><font color="#FF0000"> Activate in Effect Skill Slot. </font><br>Use Conditions:<br><font color="#FFFF00"> Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_em_jdmz03_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Five Chi Radiates Joy - Buddha's Aura</font>. <font color="#00ff00">You must learn the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br> Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Increases skill range to 15 meters and cooldown to 6 seconds, but the skill will only affect 1 target.<br><font color="#00FF00"> The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Buddha's Aura] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font><br> Use Conditions: <br><font color="#FFFF00">Must be inside the Group Martial Arts Competition Battlefield or Martial Challenge Cultivation Hall.</font>
