desc_book_wj_combo_CS_by_xlxf01_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Slash the River with an Axe - Bloody Axe</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Hitting a non-parry target refreshes the <font color="#FFAE00">"Firmament Destroyed"</font> status duration.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Bloody Axe] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_by_xlxf03_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Revolving Universe - Bloody Axe</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Bloody Axe] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_by_xlxf07_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Murderous Rage Sevenfold - Bloody Axe</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. The final hit knocks down the non-parry target if there is an active <font color="#FFAE00">"Firmament Destroyed"</font> status.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Bloody Axe] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_nrjbd01_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Scattered Petals Fill the Sky - Overcoming Affection</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Deals an extra 0.3 times Damage to enemies <font color="#f9fc00">knocked to the ground</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> by <font color="#FFAE00"">[Love and Loathing in Spring]</font>. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Overcoming Affection] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_nrjbd04_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Love and Loathing in Spring - Overcoming Affection</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Cool down time reduced by 3 seconds. If the target hit is already inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00"">[Hard to Find]</font>, <font color="#FFAE00"">[Hard to Find]</font> will be consumed and it will be regarded as successful <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion</font> from the enemy's Technique. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Overcoming Affection] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xy_nrjbd07_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Beauty Fades with Age - Overcoming Affection</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. If the target is male, enters <font color="#FFAE00"">[Fragile Beauty]</font> status when casting: Increases <font color="#FFAE00"">[For Females Only]</font> set Damage by 40%. <font color="#FFAE00"">[Fragile Beauty]</font> status will weaken every 2 seconds by 10%. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Overcoming Affection] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_whjf02_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Brilliant Moon - Unyielding</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Unyielding] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_whjf03_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">One Horizon - Unyielding</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Ending skill becomes faster.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Unyielding] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_whjf06_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Rally the Legions - Unyielding</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. You obtain "Rally the Legions" status after hitting a non-parry target and use this technique to increase Damage by 10%.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Unyielding] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sj_syxz02_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Three Yang Dark Needle - Unchoke Meridian</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Slightly increases skill damage. Target in the <font color="#f9fc00">[Soul Breaker]</font> status will be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed down</font> by 30%. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Unchoke Meridian] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sj_syxz05_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Guiding Needle - Unchoke Meridian</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>Once the <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle" </font>status ends, the target's HP recovery effect will be increased by 50% for 5 seconds, and the effect will weaken by 10% per second. <br>Taking damage when the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> status is active will Slow down by an additional 10% for 5 seconds. Effect can be stacked 3 times. Clears the Slow down effect when the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> status is over. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Unchoke Meridian] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_sj_syxz08_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers - Unchoke Meridian</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br/>The technique can be cast without full Charge, but the initial recovery amount is reduced. The longer the Charge time, the higher is the recovery amount. Once the full charge is released, the skill can be added to "Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers - Unchoke Meridian" status: Recover an additional 10% of lost HP within 5 seconds of receiving critical damage. Effect can only be triggered once. <br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Unchoke Meridian] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_lhbwq02_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Fierce Dragon Shows Claws - Dragontiger Rupture</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Grants <font color="#FF3030">"Become a Dragon"</font> status if the player has 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pounce</font> status.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Dragontiger Rupture] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_lhbwq03_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Dragon Swims Everywhere - Dragontiger Rupture</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Grants Yellow Armor if the player has <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Flight</font> status.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Dragontiger Rupture] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_jh_lhbwq07_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Tiger Steals the Heart - Dragontiger Rupture</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Grants 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pounce</font> status upon successfully breaking enemy's defense. <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Heart</font> status bonus effect: Using Flying Skills results in falling down.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Dragontiger Rupture] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xjz_wmcf07_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Flood of Black Ink - Close</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Slightly increases Faint duration, making attacks smoother.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Close] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xjz_wmcf03_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">Trick in the Sleeve - Close</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. Inflicts the enemy <font color="#FF3030">entering</font> the aura with <font color="#FFAE00">"Out of Ink"</font> status.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Close] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
desc_book_wj_combo_CS_xjz_wmcf06_power_chaoswar=Right-click to learn the Martial Skill <font color="#FF0000">So Close Yet So Far - Close</font>.<font color="#00ff00"> You must have learned the corresponding skill of this martial skill to use it.</font><br>Martial Skill Description: <br>Slightly increases skill damage. The skill target changes to the selected target.<br><font color="#00FF00">The special effects of this set's skills will change if you've activated all the [Close] Martial Skills. </font><br><font color="#FF0000">Activate in Effect Skill Slot.</font>
